<title>POLAND: Polish NFI Fortuna revises down 1996 net profit.</title>
<headline>Polish NFI Fortuna revises down 1996 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish National Investment Fund (NFI) No 13, Fortuna, revised down last year's net profit to 20.6 million zlotys from earlier reported 38.7 million, the fund said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It also revised down its net assets to 469.9 million zlotys from earlier reported 489.7 million.</p>
<p>It gave no further details and no official in in the fund was immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>Under the government's NFI programme, shares in about 500 mid-sized companies are allocated to 15 NFIs run by foreign and domestic management firms.</p>
<p>Each NFI has 31,026,185 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
